WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.716
Tina: What if we just put the magic clay on the flower?

2
00:00:14.717 --> 00:00:19.583
Brad: I guess we could try that.

3
00:00:19.584 --> 00:00:21.739
Danny: That didn’t work.

4
00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.139
Tina: The clay is too heavy.

5
00:00:24.140 --> 00:00:27.186
Brad: Maybe if the clay was smaller . . .

6
00:00:27.187 --> 00:00:31.153
Danny: I’ve got an idea!

7
00:00:31.154 --> 00:00:32.969
Tina: What’s that?

8
00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.010
Danny: A pepper shaker!

9
00:00:35.011 --> 00:00:44.221
With it, I can sprinkle red powder.

10
00:00:44.222 --> 00:00:45.574
Tina: Look!

11
00:00:45.575 --> 00:00:50.032
Danny: My imagination saves the day again!

12
00:00:50.033 --> 00:00:54.373
Brad: Yes, but how can we sprinkle powder on every flower?

13
00:00:54.374 --> 00:01:06.609
Tina: Yeah, that would take forever.

14
00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:08.637
Tina: What is that?

15
00:01:08.638 --> 00:01:11.266
Brad: It’s a huge dragonfly!

16
00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:16.786
Danny: It’s coming right at us.

17
00:01:16.787 --> 00:01:19.986
Brad: Duck!

18
00:01:19.987 --> 00:01:23.640
Tina: Bello, lie down!

19
00:01:23.641 --> 00:01:25.012
Bello: Nap time?

20
00:01:25.013 --> 00:01:27.885
Tina: That’s right, it’s nap time.

21
00:01:27.886 --> 00:01:30.939
Danny: Do you think it’s gone?

22
00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:36.715
Brad: No! Stay down!

23
00:01:36.716 --> 00:01:40.107
Danny: Oh no! Did you see what it did?

24
00:01:40.108 --> 00:01:42.551
Tina: It ate the red flower.

25
00:01:42.552 --> 00:01:45.037
Brad: What are we going to do now?

26
00:01:45.038 --> 00:01:48.629
Danny: We’ve got to squash that evil insect!

27
00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:50.391
Tina: But how?

28
00:01:50.392 --> 00:01:54.202
Danny: There’s got to be a way.

29
00:01:54.203 --> 00:02:03.231
Brad: It’s coming back. Hide!

30
00:02:03.232 --> 00:02:04.717
Bello: Tree!

31
00:02:04.718 --> 00:02:07.561
Tina: We should be safe here.

32
00:02:07.562 --> 00:02:11.638
Brad: What’s it doing?

33
00:02:11.639 --> 00:02:13.941
Danny: It spit its fangs!

34
00:02:13.942 --> 00:02:18.602
Tina: They’re coming right at us!

35
00:02:18.603 --> 00:02:20.731
Brad: We’re doomed!

36
00:02:20.732 --> 00:02:23.754
Danny: Quick, dive into the stream!

37
00:02:23.755 --> 00:02:24.922
Tina: What?

38
00:02:24.923 --> 00:02:36.113
Danny: Dive into the stream and hold your breath!

39
00:02:36.114 --> 00:02:39.643
Brad: You forgot to warn us to take a deep breath!

40
00:02:39.644 --> 00:02:41.218
Danny: It’s okay now.

41
00:02:41.219 --> 00:02:42.954
I think it’s gone.

42
00:02:42.955 --> 00:02:45.342
Tina: Bello, you’ll get dirty.

43
00:02:45.343 --> 00:02:47.019
It’s too muddy.

44
00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.056
Bello: Mud.

45
00:02:49.057 --> 00:02:51.747
Brad: Do you hear what I hear?

46
00:02:51.748 --> 00:02:54.508
Danny: Where is it?

47
00:02:54.509 --> 00:02:58.096
Tina: There it is!

48
00:02:58.097 --> 00:03:01.721
All three: Ahhhhhh!
